  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developpement d`une interface 4x1000 pour acceder   ABC-Map, NEXT et AURORA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">-	Development of a set of multi-purpose tools on knowledge and biodiversity preservation, mitigation and adaptation to climate change: Adaptation, Biodiversity and Carbon Mapping Tool (ABC-Map), the Nationally Determined Contribution Expert Tool (NEXT) and the Platform for Assessment, Understanding and Reporting of Restoration Actions (AURORA)
-	Track progress against an established baseline. In their approaches, the tools make it possible to serve to a wider variety of users, from the small promoter of projects or investments, to the national political decision-makers, and also facilitate the evaluation of the impact of their projects, investments and policies
-	Development of an interface that would allow any user to easily access the tools. The interface would provide important information related to the objectives of the &quot;4 per 1000&quot; Initiative on the ability of the project, investments and policies to contribute, at their scale and via carbon sequestration in the soil, to objectives of the three Rio conventions</narrative>
  </description>
